Free plan supports 1 custom domain email

Same process — add MX records at your registrar

Steps regardless of provider:

Sign up with your chosen provider

Verify you own bodyandsleeves.com by adding a TXT record at your registrar

Add their MX records to your domain DNS

Create the info@ mailbox

Where is your domain registered? (GoDaddy, Namecheap, Cloudflare, etc.)

